#: about/faq.rst:365
#, fuzzy
msgid "I have a great idea for Rebel Engine. How can I share it?"
msgstr "Tenho uma grande ideia para Godot. Como posso compartilhar essa ideia?"

#: about/faq.rst:367
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"It might be tempting to want to bring ideas to Rebel Engine, like ones that "
"result in massive core changes, some sort of mimicry of what another game "
"engine does, or alternative workflows that you'd like built into the editor. "
"These are great, and we are thankful to have such motivated people want to "
