#: about/faq.rst:385
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Please don't feel like your ideas for Rebel Toolbox are unwelcome. Instead, "
"try to reformulate them as a problem first, so developers and the community "
"have a functional foundation to ground your ideas on."
