msgid ""
"We will now use the custom drawing functionality of the Rebel Engine to draw "
"something that Rebel Engine doesn't provide functions for. As an example, "
"Rebel Engine provides a ``draw_circle()`` function that draws a whole "
"circle. However, what about drawing a portion of a circle? You will have to "
