msgstr "**antisserrilhamento:**"

#: tutorials/2d/custom_drawing_in_2d.rst:450
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Rebel Engine offers method parameters in :ref:"
"`draw_line<class_CanvasItem_method_draw_line>` to enable antialiasing, but "
