#: tutorials/math/matrices_and_transforms.rst:233
msgid "Putting it all together"
msgstr "Colocando tudo junto"

#: tutorials/math/matrices_and_transforms.rst:235
msgid ""
"We're going to apply everything we mentioned so far onto one transform. To "
