#: tutorials/platforms/customizing_html5_shell.rst:64
msgid ""
"``$HEAD_INCLUDE``: A custom string to include in the HTML document just "
"before the end of the ``<head>`` tag. It is customized in the export options "
"under the *Html / Head Include* section. While you fully control the HTML "
"page you create, this variable can be useful for configuring parts of the "
"HTML ``head`` element from the Rebel Editor, e.g. for different Web export "
"presets."
msgstr ""

#: tutorials/platforms/customizing_html5_shell.rst:70
