#: tutorials/plugins/editor/import_plugins.rst:422
msgid ""
"And that's it! Your first import plugin is done! Now get creative and make "
"plugins for your own beloved formats. This can be quite useful to write your "
"data in a custom format and then use it in Rebel Editor as if they were "
"native resources. This shows how the import system is powerful and "
"extendable."
