#: tutorials/scripting/filesystem.rst:62
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"The path ``res://`` will always point at the project root (where ``project."
"rebel`` is located, so ``res://project.rebel`` is always valid)."
msgstr ""
"O caminho ``res://`` sempre apontará para a raiz do projeto (onde ``project."
