#: tutorials/shaders/custom_postprocessing.rst:10
msgid ""
"Post-processing effects are shaders applied to a frame after Rebel Engine "
"rendered it. You first want to render your scene into a :ref:`Viewport "
"<class_Viewport>`, then render the ``Viewport`` inside a :ref:"
